<title>USA: TABLE - SIGCORP Inc Q2 net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SIGCORP Inc Q2 net down.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>			  Quarter Ended 6/30  Six Months Ended 6/30</p>
<p>				1997	1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Utility Operating Revenues</p>
<p>   Electric	     $62,222   $65,803   $127,099   $132,668</p>
<p>    Gas		    13,177    17,623     47,034     57,234</p>
<p>    Total		  75,399    83,426    174,133    189,902</p>
<p>Utility Operating Income</p>
<p>			     11,461    13,231     28,511     29,562</p>
<p>Net Income applicable to</p>
<p>   common stock	   6,263     8,837     19,377     22,109</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p>				 0.27	0.37	 0.82	 0.94</p>
<p>Average common shares</p>
<p>   outstanding	   23,631    23,631     23,631     23,631</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share and shares outstanding reflect three-for-two  stock split effective March 27, 1997.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 earnings hurt by lower electric sales to weather-sensitive  customres, higher non-fuel operating expenses and lower non-utility  income.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
